"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"component  tokens of quantity input"}]},{"type":"text","text":" objects like "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSQuantityInput"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Contains also references to semantic tokens providers so as to be able to use them to define the component tokens."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"This provider should be integrated as a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AllQuantityInputComponentTokensProvider"},{"type":"text","text":" implementation inside "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSTheme"},{"type":"text","text":" so as to provide"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"all tokens to the users. It helps users to override some of the tokens and assign them to an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSTheme"},{"type":"text","text":" implementation to use."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Custom themes can use subclass of "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeQuantityInputComponentTokensProvider"},{"type":"text","text":" and apply the provider they need."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"It implements also the protocol "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"QuantityInputComponentTokens"},{"type":"text","text":" so as to expose the component tokens for "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"tag inputs"}]},{"type":"text","text":" through any "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSTheme"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Quantity inputs"}]},{"text":" components tokens are defined with semantic tokens of sizes (from ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AllSizeSemanticTokensProvider"},{"text":"),","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and spaces (from ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AllSpaceSemanticTokensProvider"},{"text":").","type":"text"}],"fragments":[{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OrangeThemeQuantityInputComponentTokensProvider","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"OrangeThemeQuantityInputComponentTokensProvider","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","title":"OrangeThemeQuantityInputComponentTokensProvider","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/oudsthemesorange\/orangethemequantityinputcomponenttokensprovider"},"doc://OUDSThemesOrange/documentation/OUDSThemesOrange/OrangeThemeQuantityInputComponentTokensProvider/sizeMinWidth":{"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/oudsthemesorange\/orangethemequantityinputcomponenttokensprovider\/sizeminwidth","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeQuantityInputComponentTokensProvider\/sizeMinWidth","title":"sizeMinWidth","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Has for value token DimensionRawTokens._2225 (= 200)"}],"fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"sizeMinWidth","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"SizeSemanticToken","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:18OUDSTokensSemantic04SizeB5Tokena"}]}}}